<title>USA: Arch Communications Group Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Arch Communications Group Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.21		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net loss		  45,815		   19,377</p>
<p> Revs			88,413		   60,626</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,713		   20,543</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 EBITDA $31.4 million, or $1.52, vs $21.3 million, or $1.07.</p>
<p>Subscriber paging units 3.5 million vs 2.2 million.</p>
<p>Full name is Arch Communications Group Inc.</p>
